cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use RackNES or its design and implementation account, please cite the technical report below and identify the software version or commit used."
type: software
title: "RackNES: A Nintendo Entertainment System Emulator for VCV Rack"
abstract: >-
  RackNES integrates a Nintendo Entertainment System emulator with VCV Rack,
  exposing clock control, game-controller inputs, emulator-state recall, and
  individual audio channels to a modular synthesis patch. The CV Genie expander
  provides voltage-controlled game-memory intervention.
authors:
